B.acB=s(["The subscription is now called Plus, and it can be paid for right in the app, as can a groupocracy.","Numbers roll like digits on a drum, and REPutation bounces too.","The invite QR code is drawn in pluses and minuses.","Voices: hold the microphone to record, let go to send, slide left to cancel. A new player.","The host has a star on their circle, groupocracy bosses a medal.","While a photo loads, a light runs across its place.","A reaction no longer vanishes for a second.","Lists fade under the screen edges; the signs in the background are bigger."],t.s)
